OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fmoves east across the UK overnight,
OL,7,Falthough tending to become lighter and
OL,8,Fmore patchy in the far south. Coastal
OL,9,Fgales continue in the west, but
OL,10,Fgradually ease in the early hours. A
OL,11,Fwarm night towards the southeast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FRain moves east in the
OL,14,Fmorning, clearing in the afternoon.
OL,15,FSunny spells and heavy showers follow
OL,16,Fin the west. Windy but rather warm in
OL,17,Fthe east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
